<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="title">本轮独立复练</text><text>每轮封存一次，明确上交后才与原任务教师共享。参考自动分不改变首答、正式成绩或独立掌握证据。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="card">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{receipt}}" class="card"><text>已核对上交回执：{{receipt}}</text><text>尚未因回执读取参考反馈。</text></view>
  <button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">明确读取本轮状态、上交及当前获准参考反馈</button>
  <view wx:if="{{pending}}" class="card"><text>结果待确认 · {{pending.kind === 'image' ? '原图上传' : '独立上交'}} · {{pending.operationId}}</text><button bindtap="recover" disabled="{{busy}}">查询原回执</button><button bindtap="retry" disabled="{{busy || !pending.canRetry}}">明确重试同号原请求</button><button wx:if="{{pending.kind === 'image'}}" bindtap="reselectImage" disabled="{{busy}}">重新选择同一原图并核对</button><text wx:if="{{!pending.canRetry}}">原重试正文已失效，不能重造；仍可查询回执或核对云端。</text><button bindtap="abandon" disabled="{{busy}}">核对后关闭本机追踪</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{detail}}">
    <view class="card"><text>{{detail.started}} · {{detail.submitted ? '本轮已上交，不能覆盖' : '本轮尚未上交'}}</text><text wx:if="{{!detail.sourceAvailable}}">当前原讲评、确认评分或来源版本不可用，停止新执行并隐藏题目和参考反馈。本人已上交副本仍按当前身份追溯。</text><button bindtap="original" disabled="{{busy}}">回到确切原题结果重新核对</button><button bindtap="web" disabled="{{busy}}">复制本轮网页入口（网页需重新登录）</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{detail.sourceAvailable && !detail.submitted}}" class="card"><text class="heading">{{detail.question.title}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{detail.question.stem}}</text><button wx:if="{{!consent}}" bindtap="allowLocal" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">了解并允许本轮本机暂存，再编辑</button><text>本机24小时逻辑有效期在后续使用时检查，不承诺共享设备的物理擦除。本机草稿不是云端私人笔记。</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{form}}" class="card">
      <radio-group wx:if="{{form.type === 0 || form.type === 2}}" bindchange="choices"><label class="check-row" wx:for="{{form.options}}" wx:key="optionKey"><radio value="{{item.optionKey}}" checked="{{item.selected}}" disabled="{{busy || !editing}}" />{{item.optionKey}}. {{item.content}}</label></radio-group>
      <checkbox-group wx:if="{{form.type === 1}}" bindchange="choices"><label class="check-row" wx:for="{{form.options}}" wx:key="optionKey"><checkbox value="{{item.optionKey}}" checked="{{item.selected}}" disabled="{{busy || !editing}}" />{{item.optionKey}}. {{item.content}}</label></checkbox-group>
      <view wx:if="{{form.type === 3}}" wx:for="{{form.fields}}" wx:key="id"><label>{{item.stemMarker}}</label><textarea value="{{item.text}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindinput="blank" maxlength="20000" disabled="{{busy || !editing}}" aria-label="{{item.stemMarker}}的复练答案" /></view>
      <block wx:if="{{form.type === 4}}"><label>本轮自写答案</label><textarea value="{{form.value.text}}" bindinput="text" maxlength="20000" disabled="{{busy || !editing}}" aria-label="本轮复练自写答案" />
        <view wx:for="{{form.value.images}}" wx:key="attachmentId"><text>选中原图 {{index + 1}} · {{item.rotationDegrees}}°</text><button bindtap="image" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">核对原图</button><button bindtap="editImage" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" data-action="rotate" disabled="{{busy || !editing}}">旋转引用</button><button bindtap="editImage" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" data-action="up" disabled="{{busy || !editing || index === 0}}">上移</button><button bindtap="editImage" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" data-action="down" disabled="{{busy || !editing || index + 1 === form.value.images.length}}">下移</button><button bindtap="editImage" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" data-action="remove" disabled="{{busy || !editing}}">移除本轮选择</button></view>
        <button bindtap="addImage" disabled="{{busy || !editing || unpersisted || form.value.images.length >= 5}}">选择或拍摄一张原图并上传</button><text>最多5张，每张5MB，JPEG/PNG/WebP。上传、移除或旋转不共享草稿，不删除服务器历史原图。</text>
      </block>
      <button bindtap="saveLocal" disabled="{{busy || !consent}}">重新保存本机草稿</button><text wx:if="{{unpersisted}}" class="error">当前更改仅在页面内存，请勿离开。存储恢复前不上传或上交。</text><button bindtap="prepare" disabled="{{busy || !editing || unpersisted}}">核对本轮全部上交内容</button><button bindtap="clearLocal" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">明确清除本轮本机草稿</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="card"><text class="heading">本次核对的独立副本</text><text class="prewrap">{{preview.value.text}}</text><text>选择：{{preview.value.selectedOptionKeys}}</text><text class="prewrap" wx:for="{{preview.fields}}" wx:key="id">{{item.stemMarker}}：{{item.text}}</text><button wx:for="{{preview.value.images}}" wx:key="attachmentId" bindtap="image" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">核对选中原图 {{index + 1}} · {{item.rotationDegrees}}°</button>
      <checkbox-group bindchange="sharing"><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="share" checked="{{share}}" disabled="{{busy}}" />我确认将上方全部作答与选中图片共享给原任务教师。</label><label class="check-row"><checkbox value="practice" checked="{{practiceOnly}}" disabled="{{busy}}" />我了解这是独立复练，不覆盖首答或正式成绩，不增加独立掌握证据。</label></checkbox-group><button type="primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy || !editing || unpersisted || !share || !practiceOnly}}">再次确认并封存本轮上交</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{detail.submitted}}" class="card"><text class="heading">本人本轮已上交副本</text><text class="prewrap">{{detail.response.text}}</text><text>已选键值：{{detail.response.selectedOptionKeys}}</text><text class="prewrap" wx:for="{{detail.response.blanks}}" wx:key="blankId">空格 {{item.blankId}}：{{item.text}}</text><button wx:for="{{detail.response.images}}" wx:key="attachmentId" bindtap="image" data-id="{{item.attachmentId}}" disabled="{{busy}}">已上交原图 {{index + 1}} · {{item.rotationDegrees}}°</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{detail.feedback}}" class="card"><text class="heading">当前开放的参考反馈</text><text>参考自动分 {{detail.feedback.total}} / {{detail.feedback.max}}；需人工核对的空值不当作0分。</text><text class="prewrap">{{detail.feedback.stem}}</text><text wx:for="{{detail.feedback.options}}" wx:key="key">{{item.key}}. {{item.content}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{detail.feedback.answers}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{detail.feedback.reference}}</text><text wx:for="{{detail.feedback.blankAnswers}}" wx:key="id">{{item.marker}}：{{item.answers}}</text><text class="prewrap" wx:for="{{detail.feedback.points}}" wx:key="id">{{item.description}} · {{item.total}} / {{item.max}}</text><text class="prewrap">{{detail.feedback.analysis}}</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{detail.images.length}}" class="card"><text class="heading">本人已确认上传</text><text>未选择图片不随上交共享。本人原图可按当前身份核对。</text><view wx:for="{{detail.images}}" wx:key="id"><button bindtap="image" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看 {{item.fileName}}</button><button wx:if="{{form.type === 4}}" bindtap="addUploaded" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || !editing || form.value.images.length >= 5}}">明确加入本轮选择</button></view></view>
  </block>
  <view wx:if="{{localPreview}}" class="card"><text>本人暂存内容，当前无法继续原来源，不表示已上交。</text><text class="prewrap">{{localPreview.text}}</text><text>选择：{{localPreview.selectedOptionKeys}}</text><text wx:for="{{localPreview.blanks}}" wx:key="blankId">空格 {{item.blankId}}：{{item.text}}</text><button bindtap="clearLocal" disabled="{{busy || pending}}">明确清除本轮本机草稿</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="image-panel"><text>本人原图预览 · {{imageRotation}}°，可缩放拖动</text><movable-area class="image-area"><movable-view class="image-view" direction="all" scale="true" scale-min="1" scale-max="3"><image src="{{imagePath}}" class="answer-image" mode="aspectFit" aria-label="本人本轮复练原始图片" style="transform: rotate({{imageRotation}}deg);" /></movable-view></movable-area><button bindtap="closeImage">关闭原图</button></view>
</view>
